-for-snow-melting-heated-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"hero_video_C8yxMT":{"type":"hero-video","settings":{"title":"create the perfect \nsnow melting system","title_size":49,"subheading":"Forget the shoveling this year","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-center horizontal-center","video_url":"{{ product.metafields.custom.video_hero.value }}","overlay_opacity":10,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"2a519bee-851d-4d74-a7c4-1d5c5ecfc101":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14511745630337__2a519bee-851d-4d74-a7c4-1d5c5ecfc101-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":""}},"template--14511745630337__2a519bee-851d-4d74-a7c4-1d5c5ecfc101-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.rich_text_heading_1.value }}<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14511745630337__2a519bee-851d-4d74-a7c4-1d5c5ecfc101-heading-1","template--14511745630337__2a519bee-851d-4d74-a7c4-1d5c5ecfc101-text-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"7b14519c-62eb-4d7c-93e9-93829357b0ca":{"type":"logo-list","blocks":{"template--14501101764737__7b14519c-62eb-4d7c-93e9-93829357b0ca-1686765656b38dcd3b-0":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.logo_list_image_1.value }}","link":""}},"template--14501101764737__7b14519c-62eb-4d7c-93e9-93829357b0ca-1686765656b38dcd3b-1":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.logo_list_image_2.value }}","link":""}},"template--14501101764737__7b14519c-62eb-4d7c-93e9-93829357b0ca-1686765656b38dcd3b-2":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.logo_list_image_3.value }}","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14501101764737__7b14519c-62eb-4d7c-93e9-93829357b0ca-1686765656b38dcd3b-0","template--14501101764737__7b14519c-62eb-4d7c-93e9-93829357b0ca-1686765656b38dcd3b-1","template--14501101764737__7b14519c-62eb-4d7c-93e9-93829357b0ca-1686765656b38dcd3b-2"],"settings":{"title":"","logo_opacity":100,"divider":false}},"text-and-image":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_1_image.value }}","image_width":500,"subtitle":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_1_sub_heading.value }}","title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_1_heading.value }}","text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_1_description | metafield_tag }} <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text_and_image_cJrV3R":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/TUV_Certified.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"UL & CSA Certified for Electric Heating Safety","text":"<p><strong>UL 499 Certified – Trusted U.S. Safety<\/strong><br\/><br\/><strong>HotStep Snow Melting Mats<\/strong> meet UL 499 standards for electric heating appliances, minimizing risks like fire or electric shock. Ideal for safe snow-clearing at home or in commercial spaces.<\/p><p><strong>CSA C22.2 No. 72-10 Certified – Canadian-Approved<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Our mats also comply with CSA safety standards for portable electric heaters—ensuring quality, durability, and safety across Canadian winters.<\/p><p>These certified <strong>snowmelt mats<\/strong> offer peace of mind as a safer alternative to <strong>snow salt<\/strong> and <strong>ice melt<\/strong> products.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text_and_image_nDLkPE":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1x1_night-100.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Illuminate Your Way: Safer, Snow-Free Surfaces Day and Night","title":"Hot Step Glow Snow Melting Heated Mats","text":"<p><strong>HotStep Glow Snow Melting Heated Mats<\/strong> combine efficient <strong>snow melting mats<\/strong> technology with a glow-in-the-dark strip for improved nighttime visibility. Ideal for walkways, driveways, and entrances, these <strong>snowmelt mats<\/strong> help prevent slips and falls—without the hassle of <strong>ice melt<\/strong> or <strong>snow salt<\/strong>.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"569d9039-7a04-4f4e-aaf3-8625ac05042b":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_image.value }}","image_width":500,"subtitle":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_sub_heading.value }}","title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_heading.value }}","text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_description | metafield_tag }}<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"rich_text_wQMqEi":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_AyUNF8":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"How HotStep Snow Melting Mats Work?"}},"text_7n7WXa":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>HotStep snow melting mats heat just above freezing to melt snow on contact—keeping walkways, driveways, and stairs clear and safe. Crafted from durable, weather-resistant materials, these snowmelt mats are built for tough Canadian winters.<\/p><p>Easily connect multiple mats to cover larger areas and eliminate the need for ice melt, snow salt, or constant shoveling. Perfect for both residential and commercial snow removal, they offer an energy-efficient solution for staying safe all season.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_AyUNF8","text_7n7WXa"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"text_columns_8Um7kB":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_MrJP6U":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cover_Custom_Areas_e3a770da-ccfa-41d4-8b50-fd53ecf20942.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"How do I connect multiple mats to cover a large area?","text":"<p>HotStep snow melting mats feature built-in male and female connectors, making it easy to daisy-chain multiple snowmelt mats together for custom coverage. Whether you're clearing a long walkway or a wide entrance, the connectors snap together quickly, even in freezing conditions or while wearing gloves.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"text_block_N4ye9N":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Buying_Guide_GIFs_4_6971e9ac-e3b6-41fb-8e29-be43fb8a34c7.gif","image_width":650,"title":"How much snow can the mats melt per hour, and how quickly do they work?","text":"<p>HotStep snow melting mats melt approximately <strong>1.5 to 2.5 inches of snow per hour<\/strong>, depending on ambient temperature and snow or ice buildup. These efficient snowmelt mats begin heating within minutes, working quickly to replace the need for snow salt or ice melt.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"text_block_YjPU7r":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DJI_0747_b.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"How energy-efficient are the mats, and will they increase my electricity bill?","text":"<p>HotStep snow melting mats are up to <strong>20% more energy-efficient<\/strong> than other snowmelt mats. They melt snow faster at the same wattage, helping you save on electricity—and reduce your use of snow salt or ice melt.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["text_block_MrJP6U","text_block_N4ye9N","text_block_YjPU7r"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"text_columns_R8fzJP":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_PdAGgR":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Waterproof.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Are the mats waterproof and safe to leave outside all winter?","text":"<p>Yes, HotStep snow melting mats are fully waterproof and built for Canadian winters. Made with <strong>durable rubber<\/strong> and <strong>watertight connectors<\/strong>, they’re safe to leave outdoors through snow, rain, and freezing temperatures — no more shoveling, snow salt, or ice melt needed.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"text_block_XmtNin":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Hot_Step_Mats_-_Durability.gif","image_width":650,"title":"Can the mats handle heavy vehicles like trucks or SUVs?","text":"<p>Yes — HotStep snow melting mats are built with <strong>heavy-duty rubber<\/strong> and enclosed heating film, tough enough to support the weight of cars, trucks, and SUVs. Ideal for driveways and other high-traffic areas.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"text_block_PRBKUg":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Stairs.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Are the mats safe to use on stairs and uneven surfaces?","text":"<p>Absolutely. HotStep snowmelt mats are designed for <strong>stairs<\/strong> and <strong>irregular surfaces<\/strong>, helping <strong>prevent slips and falls<\/strong> by keeping snow and ice from accumulating.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["text_block_PdAGgR","text_block_XmtNin","text_block_PRBKUg"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"featured_video_fYknQm":{"type":"featured-video","settings":{"title":"Say Goodbye to Snow & Ice – Your Smartest Winter Upgrade","video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=1L7bmUjP0T4","divider":fal